### Third-party rights notice

- **Classical Chinese source texts** (Taishō / CBETA canon) are public-domain
  historical works; CBETA markup and databases have their own terms — consult
  https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/ before bulk reuse of CBETA materials.
- **Published modern translations** quoted or reconstructed within the
  comparative matrix remain the property of their respective translators and
  publishers (Red Pine, Thomas Cleary, Ruth Fuller Sasaki, D.T. Suzuki,
  R.H. Blyth, John Blofeld, Steven Heine, Philip Yampolsky, et al.). They are
  referenced here for scholarly comparison only; matrix attributions are
  verified/labeled under `data/translations/provenance.json`. Each verified
  source resolves to `data/translations/rights_manifest.json`; that manifest
  is an editorial control record, **not** a license grant or legal opinion.
  Do not redistribute quotations as if they were original published text.
